WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Bright red flowers are blooming in the garden.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.500
A little moth smells the flowers and flies closer.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.800
It beats its wings and hovers like a tiny airplane.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:21.200
It reaches into a flower with its long tongue and drinks sweet nectar.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.700
Pollen sticks to its body and travels to another flower.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:32.200
The moth and flowers help each other. Nature is amazing!
